      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 7.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Doctor, I've checked them in and done the preliminary measurements, I'll hand them over when you ask."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.67,
      "end_seconds": 14.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.14,
      "end_seconds": 19.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Um, so... mouth ulcers. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.32,
      "end_seconds": 24.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.67,
      "end_seconds": 28.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 30.34,
      "end_seconds": 38.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temp 36.7 degrees, pressure 127 over 82, heart rate 67, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.64,
      "end_seconds": 40.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.27,
      "end_seconds": 45.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.11,
      "end_seconds": 49.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.92,
      "end_seconds": 65.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and your weight is stable on the scales."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.22,
      "end_seconds": 73.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.3,
      "end_seconds": 94.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Any diarrhoea, vomiting or bone pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.93,
      "end_seconds": 106.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no diarrhoea, vomiting or bone pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.18,
      "end_seconds": 111.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.23,
      "end_seconds": 114.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.79,
      "end_seconds": 117.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.99,
      "end_seconds": 120.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.4,
      "end_seconds": 124.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.28,
      "end_seconds": 128.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.04,
      "end_seconds": 144.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.63,
      "end_seconds": 150.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Uh, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.36,
      "end_seconds": 161.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 168.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.57,
      "end_seconds": 186.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.47,
      "end_seconds": 208.37,
      "duration_seconds": 20.9,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I grab fast food at lunch most days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.25,
      "end_seconds": 225.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it points towards coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.71,
      "end_seconds": 228.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Oh, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.34,
      "end_seconds": 251.66,
      "duration_seconds": 21.32,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get a blood count, for coeliac follow-up. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.6,
      "end_seconds": 254.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.65,
      "end_seconds": 272.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "text": "I'm going to order coeliac antibodies, for coeliac follow-up. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Check labels carefully and use separate toasters and chopping boards. I'll also refer you to the dietitian."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.78,
      "end_seconds": 274.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.18,
      "end_seconds": 293.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. Come back in twelve months. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.52,
      "end_seconds": 299.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "So, I come back in twelve months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.4,
      "end_seconds": 306.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.23,
      "end_seconds": 311.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
